    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless school hallway. Anomalies will appear in some hallways if you see one turn back. Try to reach the exit after level 8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See an anomaly turn back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you don't find an anomaly keep pushing forward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are backwards levels and forward levels each with their own set of anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 0 is always safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The exit is after level 8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distorted hallways is a walking simulator anomaly game inspired by The Exit 8. The game is only available in English and Controller support will eventually come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-30 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only settings for Texture Quality, Foliage Quality, and Volume.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless school hallway. Anomalies will appear in some hallways if you see one turn back. Try to reach the exit after level 8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See an anomaly turn back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you don't find an anomaly keep pushing forward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are backwards levels and forward levels each with their own set of anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 0 is always safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The exit is after level 8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distorted hallways is a walking simulator anomaly game inspired by The Exit 8. The game is only available in English and Controller support will eventually come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-30 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only settings for Texture Quality, Foliage Quality, and Volume.\u00a0</p>",
